TITLE Albite kinetic dissolution with H2S gas at 200 C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    Fe(+3) 0.004
    Fe(+2) 0.004
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    -volume 1
    H2S(g) 5
KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m 1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -steps 1000 in 100
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
    -step true
    -time true
    -gases H2S(g)
END
